# Generated experiment artifacts — battery captures and offline-analysis outputs,
# not source. These are produced by the scripts here (discharge/charger logs and
# their plots/summaries); none are meant to be committed.
#
# Scripts (*.py) and docs (*.md) stay tracked. To commit a specific run as a
# fixture, force it: `git add -f <file>`.
*.csv
*.jsonl
*.png
*.summary.json
